	    `keySelected`, `keyPressed`, `bindChosenKeyUp`) and its own InputBegan
	    handler. It is `Binds.captureNext` and three locals now, and the pending
	    capture is cancelled when the window closes instead of staying armed.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════]]

